{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"checkIfEligibleForSurvey","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In order to be eligible, a number of conditions must be fulfilled:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The library is in an enabled state. If the user has previously declined an invite"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or completed a survey, the library will be in a disabled state. Otherwise, the library is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in an enabled state."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The user has met the loyalty threshold defined in your exp_configuration.json file."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The user is in the sampling pool. If the previous two conditions have been met, the library","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"makes an HTTP call to our servers to determine if the user is in the sampling pool. If s\/he is,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the invite will be presented. If not, the invite will not be shown. Disable this remote check with"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"setSkipPoolingCheck:"}]}]}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"Checks to see if the user is currently eligible to be invited to a survey.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.Verint.EXPPredictive\/documentation\/EXPPredictive","doc:\/\/com.Verint.EXPPredictive\